  "apply-to-everywhere-user-configuration-and-its-c": "<form id=\"settings-form\">{{0}}<label class=\"field\"><span>Apply to</span><select name=\"_scope\"><option value=\"/\">Everywhere (user configuration)</option><option value=\"{{1}}\">{{2}} and its children</option></select></label><p><button type=\"button\" data-edit-config>Edit rc file</button> <button type=\"button\" data-reload-config>Reload configuration and plugins</button></p><small>Settings are saved as ordinary sections in {{3}}/rc. <code>settings_fields</code> changes the fields in this menu.</small>{{4}}<div class=\"dialog-actions\"><button class=\"primary\">Save settings</button></div></form>",
