  "burnt-offering-support-the-work-piece-offering-s": "{{0}}{{1}}<div class=\"menu-list\"><button data-command=\"burnt\">Burnt Offering <span>Support the work ↗</span></button><button data-command=\"piece\">Piece Offering <span>Share something you made ↗</span></button></div>",
  "1-create-the-ld-stripe-account-use-the-business-": "{{0}}{{1}}<div class=\"setup-step\"><h3>1. Create the LD Stripe account</h3><p>Use the business email. Stripe’s activation flow asks for business and identity details. Enter those on Stripe.</p><button class=\"primary\" data-url=\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/register\">Open Stripe signup ↗</button></div><div class=\"setup-step\"><h3>2. Connect a bank for payouts</h3><p>During activation, add the bank account that should receive payouts. Stripe may require verification before live payments work.</p><button data-url=\"https://docs.stripe.com/get-started/account/activate\">Account activation guide ↗</button></div><div class=\"setup-step\"><h3>3. Make a Payment Link in a sandbox</h3><p>Choose “Customers choose what to pay.” Name it Burnt Offering, choose any suggested amount, and test the checkout. Stripe’s documentation links the current requirements for tips and donations.</p><button data-url=\"https://docs.stripe.com/payment-links/create\">Payment Links instructions ↗</button><button data-url=\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/payment-links\">Open Payment Links ↗</button></div><div class=\"setup-step\"><h3>4. Connect the live link</h3><p>After activation and testing, create the live link and put <code>stripe_payment_link='https://buy.stripe.com/…'</code> in your user rc. No secret API key belongs in this app. Add a backend and webhooks later if account upgrades need payment verification.</p><button data-command=\"edit-config\">Open user rc</button></div><p class=\"warning\">This is a setup guide. No payment is being collected by this stub.</p>{{2}}",
  "recipient-yhwh-thedynamiclinker-com-no-file-is-u": "{{0}}{{1}}<p>Recipient: <a href=\"mailto:yhwh@thedynamiclinker.com\">yhwh@thedynamiclinker.com</a>. No file is uploaded by this stub.</p><button class=\"primary\" data-command=\"choose-offering\">Choose file and prepare email…</button><button data-url=\"https://thedynamiclinker.com\">Visit LD ↗</button>",
  "-about-us-genesis-by-the-nameless-": "{{0}}<span class=\"paleo\">𐤉𐤄𐤅𐤄</span>{{1}}<div class=\"dialog-actions\"><button data-url=\"https://thedynamiclinker.com\">About Us ↗</button><button class=\"primary\" data-url=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HNQ23QKT\">Genesis by The Nameless ↗</button></div>",
