  "help": "Help",
  "each-tab-is-a-directory-a-shell-and-an-optional-": "<p>Each tab is a directory, a shell, and an optional file. Going up never closes the file. The terminal stays alive while hidden. No browsing directory needs configuration.</p><div class=\"shortcut-list\">{{0}}</div><p>The file manager also supports ↑/↓, Enter, Left/Backspace to go up, F2 to rename, Ctrl+C/X/V, Ctrl+A, and Delete to move to Trash. Double-click opens a directory or file. Ctrl+click selects multiple files.</p><p><button data-command=\"edit-config\">Edit user rc</button><button data-command=\"open-guide\">Open the full guide</button><button data-command=\"about\">About YHWH</button><button data-url=\"https://thedynamiclinker.com\">About Us ↗</button></p>",
